OL,3,GNEWSACapybara pups at Manx zoo draw
OL,4,Arecord crowds
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurraghs Wildlife Park has experienced
OL,7,Fits busiest October weekend ever after
OL,8,Fthe birth of eight capybara pups, which
OL,9,Fstaff say have "delighted" people and
OL,10,Fboosted conservation funding.
OL,12,FThe pups were born to two females
OL,13,Fwithin days of each other, on 26
OL,14,FSeptember and 1 October.
OL,16,FTheir arrival has sparked huge public
OL,17,Finterest, with the park's manager
OL,18,FKathleen Graham saying the reaction to
OL,19,Fthis "overload of cuteness" had been
OL,20,Fextraordinary.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
