OL,3,GNEWSACapybara pups at Manx zoo draw
OL,4,Arecord crowds
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The car park was full, it was like a
OL,7,Fbank holiday. Everybody coming to see
OL,8,Fthe capybara babies," she said.
